# Directory Table Standard

All **existing and future** directory/data tables must follow the Appointments
design (`src/components/orders/orders-workspace.tsx`, route `/appointments`).

New tables ship with this chrome. When you touch a legacy directory that does
not match, align it to this template in the same change — do not invent or
extend a second visual system.

Catalog tables use `CatalogTableToolbar` / `CatalogDataTable` /
`CatalogTablePagination` — those wrappers must still produce this same chrome
and compact density.

## Shell

```tsx
<PageHeader … />
{/* optional DirectoryInsightsFlip with className="mt-6" */}
<Card className="gap-0"> {/* mt-6 on Card OR on insights wrapper — not both */}
  <CardHeader className="gap-3 border-b py-4 pb-3">
    <TableDirectoryToolbar /* or CatalogTableToolbar */ … />
  </CardHeader>
  {/* errors: border-b px-6 py-3 */}
  <TableSelectionToolbar /* no View; selection parity */ … />
  <DirectoryTableLoader … /> {/* initial load */}
  <DataTable density="compact" /* default is compact */ … onRowClick={view} />
  <div className="flex flex-col gap-3 border-t px-6 py-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
    {/* listSummary + TablePaginationControls */}
  </div>
</Card>
```

## Required look and behavior

- **Density:** `DataTable` uses **compact** (portal default). Do not pass
  `density="default"` on directory tables.
- **Card / header / footer:** See `table-header-divider-spacing.mdc`.
- **Sizing:** Content-first height; no viewport `min-h` stretch — see
  `table-directory-sizing.mdc`.
- **Loading:** Prefer `DirectoryTableLoader` for initial load; empty/pending
  use `DataTable`’s `px-6 py-12` empty slot.
- **Inline errors:** `border-b px-6 py-3` (destructive text) between header and
  body — not `py-8` or ungapped banners.
- **Selection:** `TableSelectionToolbar` under the divider. No View on the bar
  (row click opens view). Non-view row actions need selection parity — see
  `table-selection-action-parity.mdc`.
- **Pagination:** Footer uses `TablePaginationControls` + list summary inside
  `border-t px-6 py-4` (catalogs: `CatalogTablePagination`).

## Exceptions (do not force-fit)

- **Change Requests** — form + card list, not a directory table
- **Maps / label updater / full-screen form tabs** — non-directory shells
- **User Activities** — read-only audit; still use compact table chrome; may
  omit destructive actions
- **Reserved invoices** — may keep cursor pagination / assign workflow; card
  chrome and compact table must still match

## Checklist

- [ ] `Card` has `gap-0`; `CardHeader` is `gap-3 border-b py-4 pb-3`
- [ ] Compact `DataTable` (default or explicit)
- [ ] Error banners use `border-b px-6 py-3`
- [ ] Footer is `border-t px-6 py-4` + `TablePaginationControls` (or catalog
      equivalent)
- [ ] Selection bar has no View; non-view actions have parity
- [ ] No directory viewport `min-h` stretch
- [ ] Touched legacy directories migrated to this shell, not left diverged
